        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Heat, natural gas, at boiler atm. low-NOx condensing non-modulating &lt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Heat, natural gas, at boiler atm. low-NOx condensing non-modulating &lt;100kW
na;
Synonyms: Brennwerttechnik; 
UUID: 7742b343-d653-3d6c-a747-975699bd4e49
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in boiler atm. low-NOx condensing non-modulating &lt;100kW" which in turn includes fuel input from low pressure (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions, and electricity needed for operation. The module uses the average net efficiency for the type of boiler (estimated from literature). The heat distribution is not included.; Geography: Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Location:  Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: Technology available in mid 1990s.
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7742b343-d653-3d6c-a747-975699bd4e49.xml</text>
